lass=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 0</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 6</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nIce Leviathan, Bunker Spider, Backwater Cryofish, Snare Flea</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nIce Leviathan</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n8</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n7</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n12</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Elevator\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Elevator</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Major_Story_Spoilers:_Decision_Aftermath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Major Story Spoilers: Decision Aftermath</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Geoffrey&#39;s_Log_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geoffrey's Log 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>Across the polar ocean of <a href=\"/wiki/Polarus\" title=\"Polarus\"><b>Polarus</b></a> lies the area named <b>Glace</b>. Originally a labratory to study the local wildlife. Now an abandoned building due to the frequent.. vibrations and disturbances within the facility. Perhaps this lab was built near something large and aggressive. High value items remain inside.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Sacrificed/Deceased.<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Cold, icy terrain, supports plant life.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> A balanced ecosystem, creatures support very agressive behaviour.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p>Glace supports Rainy, Stormy, Foggy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, and Minefield weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Elevator\">Elevator</span></h3>\n<p>To the left and north of the ship is an elevator that can be used to transport between the upper and lower level of the moon's exterior.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Major_Story_Spoilers:_Decision_Aftermath\">Major Story Spoilers: Decision Aftermath</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>If players decided to overload and blow up <a href=\"/wiki/ResearcherxB\" title=\"ResearcherxB\"><b>ResearcherxB</b></a>, debris from the ship can fall onto Glace's exterior. If players land on Glace in the future on that save file, a mild outbreak of white mold will be present on the exterior and <a href=\"/wiki/Infected_Bunker_Spider\" title=\"Infected Bunker Spider\"><b>Infected Bunker Spiders</b></a> will spawn on the exterior at the start of the day.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Progression\">Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Logging \"Geoffrey's log 3\" found on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Etern\" title=\"Etern\">Etern</a>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Calist\" title=\"Calist\"><big><b>Calist:</b></big></a> Log \"Geoffrey's log 2\" found on the exterior.</span></span><br /><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Hyve\" title=\"Hyve\"><big><b>Hyve:</b></big></a> A breakable hive has a chance to spawn on the upper level of the exterior near the west fire exit, spawning the <b>Hyve videotape</b> when broken.</span></span><br /><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/Vindict\" title=\"Vindict\"><big><b>Vindict:</b></big></a> Log \"Recovery order\" found on the exterior.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Scrap Items\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Scrap Name</th>\n<th>Image</th>\n<th>Conductive</th>\n<th>Weight (lbs)</th>\n<th>Min Value</th>\n<th>Avg Value</th>\n<th>Max Value</th>\n<th>Rarity</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Airhorn</td>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"floatnone\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Airhorn.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Airhorn.png\" src=\"/images/thumb/Airhorn.png/60px-Airhorn.png?6146f4\" decoding=\"asyn