\n<td>29.21%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roaming Locusts</td>\n<td>52</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>29.21%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Lore\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Lore\">&gt; Lore</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Geoffrey.27s_Log_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geoffrey's_Log_2\">Geoffrey's Log 2</span></h3>\n<p>This log can be found following the trail of red flairs in the tunnel behind and northwest of the ship.\n</p><p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"116\" data-mwtitle=\"Geoffrey_log_2.ogg\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Geoffrey_log_2.ogg?c9f4f0\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Geoffrey_log_2.ogg/Geoffrey_log_2.ogg.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-transcodekey=\"mp3\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Text <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">I did not expect this meeting to go the way it did.<br /><br />While I tried to educate the Emperor on the matters back at the Grand Capitol. he seemed uninterested and looked at me with a rather lifeless expression.<br />I explained how the Council of Rule is very adamant about not allowing any bioweapons to be used or studied..<br />But then he told me..<br />He wanted me to..<br /><br />The Triton Military will decimate the Grand Capitol as well as the moon it sits on.<br />This will be.. soon, on the day of the final conference.<br />Judgement day.<br /><br />And he wanted me to give the order.<br /><br />This will be the catalyst of a region wide war.<br />Yet I did as he asked. I gave the order. In the name of the Emperor.<br /><br />This means I will not be returning home and I was promised that my family will be moved to Trite to keep them safe from what\u2019s about to come.<br />I hope to see them soon.<br /><br />Soon I will be off to 61-March where I will prepare 3 groups of scientists to set course for the mysterious moon of 42-Cosmocos in hopes of finding something to aid us in the upcoming war against the dominions who will oppose the Triton Military and the Emperor.<br /><br />This will not be pleasant. But I am ready.<br /><br />Agent G- Signing off.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2></div>", "images": ["Glace_(Icon).png", "Warning-yellow.svg", "Airhorn.png", "Bottles.png", "CablesPH.png", "Cash_register.png", "Clown_horn.png", "Fancy_lamp_-_On.png", "Gift.png", "Gold_bar.png", "GoldCoinPH.png", "Golden_cup.png", "GunkfishPlushiePH.png", "Hairdryer.png", "HomemadeSporeEmitterPH.png", "Ice_cube.png", "Jewel_box.png", "Jewel_case.png", "Large_axle.png", "LegallyDistinctBatleyPH.png", "Leviathan_tooth.png", "Magnifying_glass.png", "Maneater_plushie.png", "Painting_-_Lake.png", "Perfume_bottle.png", "Picture_frame.png", "Pocketwatch.png", "PolarMilk\u2122.png", "(Ingredient)_Rubber_roll.png", "Safe.png", "Silent_package.png", "Silver_bug.png", "Silver_coin.png", "Silver_key.png", "Toy_cube.png", "Toy_robot.png", "Toy_train.png", "Tragedy.png", "Vase.png", "Watch.png", "Webley.png", "Geoffrey_log_2.ogg"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes", "Pages_with_spoilers", "Moons"]}